00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:27.240
Mr. Fox from the fox cafe... Mr. Fox...
It's the money!

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.830
Mr. Fox from the fox cafe... Mr. Fox...
Money makes the world go round, right?!

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:29.950
Money makes the world go round, right?!

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:30.830
That won't do!

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:32.870
Mr. Fox from the fox cafe, this is about my bill, isn't it?!
But...

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:35.080
Mr. Fox from the fox cafe, this is about my bill, isn't it?!

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:42.220
I'm over here... Mr. Fox... I'm right here. Here... Here...

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:48.510
Gon.

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:49.640
Hm?

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:53.350
Huh?

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:58.650
What? You're Nurarihyon...?

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:00.690
