be able to get on a baseball team.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:14.090
There's no need to belittle yourself so much.

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:19.100
Conversely, it's frightening how much working
behind the scenes seems like your calling.

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:21.350
How about being a kabuki stagehand or something?

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:29.400
Ah... uh... well... even if it's just once, I want to be
the supreme commander everyone imagines I am.

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:31.900
You've got some work to do, then.

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:35.360
First of all, you can't keep shilly-shallying like that.

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:40.120
Well... to be honest I feel kind of scared.

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:44.710
This is Nurarihyon! Nurarihyon is right here!

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:47.840
Nurarihyon! He's Nurarihyon!

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:49.630
