00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:20.700
A long time ago, there was Chinese torture technique
called "death by a thousand cuts."

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:23.500
The person's flesh is pinched, they're tied up with rope,

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:27.170
and their flesh is then cut off starting
far away from the heart and working closer to it.

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:32.300
That would allow you to stand out
while still remaining passive.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:35.880
Hey, you know, you should be more distinctive.

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:42.010
Oh, look, Mr. Hozuki's starting to get a bit irritated
at how difficult it is to get a handle on you.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:48.150
Anyway, what's this sense I'm getting? Deja vu?
I have a feeling something like this happened before...

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:56.280
You're an amusing guy,
but your appearance doesn't make an impression.

00:09:56.570 --> 00:10:00.240
If it was more distinctive, I'd be happy
to give you some news coverage, mew know.

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:05.000
