00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:15.420
In Japanese Hell, Western clothes stand out, after all.

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:16.630
Makes sense.

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:20.970
What do you think?

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:22.760
Gah...!

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:26.140
It's not bad, right? I mean, it's got some charm...

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:29.230
