00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:53.400
Aww...

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:56.900
It's quite a slippery story... isn't it?

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:13.460
I was waiting for you!

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:17.170
I'm the Nurarihyon who was introduced
just a moment ago!

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:18.170
I'll definitely become like that one day.
I'm the Nurarihyon who was introduced

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:18.170
just a moment ago!

