One day, surely...
Eat this! NURARIHYON BEAM!

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:24.340
Eat this! NURARIHYON BEAM!

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:28.220
Hana Kappo Kitsune Gozen

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:35.270
I want to eat some snake...

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:36.440
