00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:40.610
Long ago, I used to eat them
at the taibon execution grounds.

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:46.200
The snakes that have swallowed a person whole,
you see, are especially delicious.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:49.830
My desire to eat such snakes was the reason
I made the taibon in the first place.

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:57.210
By the way, Gon, as of late neither your efforts
to solicit customers nor your sales have been that good.

00:12:58.380 --> 00:13:03.880
They're quite tasty, you know...
Snakes that have swallowed their prey whole, I mean.

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:06.760
Obobobobobo
bobobobobobo

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:06.970
Obobobobobobo...!

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:12.730
Gon Gets to Work

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:17.480
I was hoping you could somehow help me out...

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:19.690
No way!

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:21.730
Just think of it as saving my skin...

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:24.280
