00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:32.830
At this rate, I'm gonna end up
either getting fired or getting eaten!

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:36.120
That's got nothing to do with me!
If you're in that much trouble,

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:38.460
