00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:40.420
That sounds even worse.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:45.630
Arriving on the job on a regular schedule,
working my tail off... Not a chance!

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:47.260
Then go and get eaten!

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:50.350
What's this commotion about?

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:53.810
Oh! Buddy, please hear me out!

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:01.980
Perhaps rather than "bring me a snake,"

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:07.320
she means "if you don't increase your sales,
I'll feed you to a snake and then eat it."

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:09.370
Could it be a warning like that?

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:10.990
You're right.

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:13.910
But, in the case of Miss Daji...

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:19.710
Increase your sales, and on top of that bring me
a snake as an apology, you worthless bum!

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.290
...would be correct.

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:25.630
If you understand the implied meaning
of your boss's words so well,

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:27.880
how'd you manage to get into this mess?

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:30.140
Well, anyway...

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:33.510
I'll give you what you want
if you help out around here for one week.

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:35.850
We're quite busy given it's Obon season, after all.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:37.640
Right now...

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:41.860
there happens to be in the Black Belly Realm
a Hell snake that's full to the point of bursting,

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:44.070
after swallowing a number of the dead whole.

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:46.190
I'll give you that one.

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:49.450
So you're saying that one's alright to eat?

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:52.530
Even if it's eaten, it will just regenerate
along with the all dead.

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:55.330
Hell snakes also regenerate?

00:14:55.580 --> 00:15:00.250
More than regenerating,
it's that they're born again... in Hell.

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.330
It's the same with the shinkuchu.

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:06.840
Whether they die, are reborn, sleep,
or wake, they still remain shinkuchu.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:10.380
That cycle kinda rubs me the wrong way...

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:17.980
They are born in Hell, die in Hell,
and then are born in Hell yet again.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:23.560
That is what we currently understand
of shinkuchu ecology.

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:25.650
How depressing...

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:27.940
However, by building up enough virtue,

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:30.530
even a bug can be reincarnated
as a human on rare occasions.

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:32.070
Ah, that makes sense.

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:36.410
Bothersome
Behavior

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:36.410
Customer
Arrogance
Abusive Language

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:34.450
So maybe this guy was a bug
in his previous incarnation?

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:36.790
Certainly are some deplorable humans out there...

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:43.880
Nevertheless, I don't think working here
for a week would jibe with my nature.

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:46.630
On top of that, it's without pay, right?

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:49.630
You're being overly optimistic, you know.

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:53.300
If you don't like my terms,
you'll have to ask for help somewhere else.

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:57.310
You could try to ask at a place where
they revere albino snakes or something.

00:15:57.760 --> 00:16:01.230
Wouldn't those ones be divine messengers?
I'd be cursed for the next seven generations!

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:06.440
Well then, how about getting Medusa
to eat until stuffed and then offer her to Daji?

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:10.190
Where's Medusa's head right now?

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:13.660
The Greek goddess Athena currently has it.

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:15.490
If you think you can take it from me, go ahead and try.

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:16.450
Not gonna happen.

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:22.120
Well, then about you butter up Satan, make him
transform into a snake, and then have her eat that?

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:26.340
Even I can tell that would spark an international incident.

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:28.550
IF YOU REJECT ALL THAT, THEN...!

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:32.260
Poisonous Snakes

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:32.260
One: Hunting for snakes in the Chinese Fengdu Hell!

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:35.510
Two: Hunting for snakes in the Egyptian Duat!

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:41.930
Three: The EU Hell. Hunting for snakes
in the seventh moat inside the eighth valley.

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:46.270
Four: Find some way to get the Mundane World
and help round up yellow-spotted pit vipers.

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:49.860
Five: Have a cat, the natural enemy of snakes,
catch one and bring it to you.

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:52.070
However, that method depends on the whims of a cat.

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:58.830
If I had that kinda ability, I would've built a house
with my own hands by this point, ya know?

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:04.040
In Duat and the EU Hell, they've got
honest-to-goodness devils and evil deities, right?

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:06.540
That's scary stuff...

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:08.210
That's right.

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:11.300
Japanese Hell is exceedingly gentlemanly in comparison.

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:14.760
Well, I suppose I'm left with no choice... Guess I'll work.

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:16.590
That's the spirit.

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:19.850
Fox Biting Realm

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:24.430
Between working at the Fox Biting Realm or the
Fiery Fox Realm of Avici Hell, which would you prefer?

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:24.480
Fox Biting Realm
Fiery Fox Realm

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:26.770
Which one would be easier?

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:28.980
Neither of them would be easy.

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:34.400
The Fox Biting Realm is where those
who badmouth people with reckless abandon end up.

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:39.700
The Fiery Fox Realm is where those
who burn down temples and the like end up.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:43.200
The Fiery Fox Realm... Isn't that where Nobunaga is?!

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:48.170
Even if he is, right now he'd be
in the middle of falling down into the blaze.

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:52.550
It takes 2,000 years to descend down
to Avici Hell, you see.

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:53.670
2,000 Years

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:58.050
Well, he received a reduced sentence
based on his position and achievements,

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:00.140
so I'm sure he didn't end up in Avici Hell.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:03.310
Oh man, I kinda wanted to see him.

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:07.390
So at that Fiery Fox or whatever it's called...

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:09.270
What I am supposed to do?

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.820
You just have to frighten the dead there.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:15.820
Aw, how tiresome... You know any tricks for that?

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:20.120
First off, how about getting rid of that archaic smile?

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:21.950
That's just the way my face is...

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:26.580
Fiery
Fox

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:26.580
Realm

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:28.540
Gah, it hurts...

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:35.050
Well, first, it's time for my personal style...

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:38.260
Hey...

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:45.140
Hiya, fella, what made you do something bad?!

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:47.480
You know Heaven's a better place, right?!

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:50.310
The alcohol's great there, and the women are beautiful!

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:52.810
You're not here to work as a tout!

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:56.360
And you don't need
to ask the dead about their life stories.

00:18:56.530 --> 00:19:01.990
But, I mean really thinking about it,
this's exactly the opposite of what I normally do.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:05.950
My deep-seated nature of serving customers
isn't to be taken lightly!

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:09.920
We don't serve customers here! We torture the dead.

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:12.580
In any case, please try to be harsh with them.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:14.130
If you want a snake, that is.

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:18.300
A week
has passed

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:21.550
I wonder how Gon is doing...

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:25.510
Wait, let me take that back.

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:27.140
No taking back a move.

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:28.980
Come on...

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:36.070
By my very nature, I'm not good at being harsh!

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:43.280
Listen here... back when I still a nursing cub,
I separated myself from the struggle for milk.

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:48.120
When I attended a temple elementary school,
I removed myself from the battle for good grades!

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:49.790
I wanna make some easy money...

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:52.500
Hey! Don't cut class, Gon!

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:56.040
When I reached the age when people hunt for jobs,
I removed myself from the war to find a good one.

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:58.130
I wanna make some easy money...

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:02.590
Talk of marriage, qualifications,
saving money, getting my own house...

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:00.510
TALK
OF
MARRIAGE

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:01.340
QUALIFICATIONS

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:02.220
SAVING
MONEY

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:03.640
MY
OWN
HOUSE

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:04.300
I separated myself from all of that.

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:06.810
I wanna make some easy money...

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:11.690
Having separated myself from all such things,
I live by the ideals of pacifism and individualism!

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:16.310
Then, why do you work for Daji,
who's about as far from peaceful as you can get.

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:19.070
I just settled in where I was able to settle down.

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:22.320
Are you sure you don't mean
you tumbled down to where you dropped?

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:25.700
In any case, I'm afraid I can't give you a snake.

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:27.450
Come on, gimme one!

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:31.330
Daji, guys like this are trouble, wouldn't you agree?

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:32.460
Huh?!

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:35.920
Gon.

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:38.630
Miss Daji! You've come all the way here?!

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:41.720
Gon.

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:45.550
Guys like you are truly hopeless.

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:48.600
Say your prayers!

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:07.200
Gah! Ow, ow, ow!

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:16.420
I really wanted to make some easy money...

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:20.340
Excuse me...

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:22.380
Have at it.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:26.550
You've frightened the dead enough
that I consider the week's worth of work made up for.

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:28.510
I offer this to you.

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:30.010
Oh my!

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:33.430
Hearing that makes me feel a whole lot better.

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:36.140
Gon, carry that back and cook it up for me.

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:44.360
You know, as the only one who's able to get me to work,
Daji is something like a restorative tonic to me.

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:48.700
I see, seems you really did settle in
where you were able to settle down.

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:52.620
The world is actually a well put together place, huh?

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:10.720
Uso yo. Janakya naze koko ni tadoritsuku no?
That's a lie. If not, why do you find your way here?

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:17.310
Enma-sama no mae de nao shira o kiru no ne
Even in front of Lord Enma, you feign ignorance

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:23.230
Baka ne. Dakedo sonna toko tamaranakute
You're an idiot. But I can't get enough of that aspect of you

00:22:23.980 --> 00:22:29.610
Teitaraku. Onaji tsumi kasanetsuzuketa
What a predicament. You continued to repeat the same sin

00:22:30.280 --> 00:22:34.910
Ii no? Yubikiri genman.
Is that alright? Pinky swear.

00:22:34.910 --> 00:22:36.290
(E?)
(Huh?)

00:22:34.910 --> 00:22:36.290
Ii no? Yubikiri genman.
Is that alright? Pinky swear.

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:41.130
Gachi ni honto ni naru yo.
It will seriously become reality.

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:42.710
(Dogii!)
(Startling!)
Gachi ni honto ni naru yo.
It will seriously become reality.

00:22:43.090 --> 00:22:49.090
Tensei o matazu shounetsu no mama ni
Without waiting for reincarnation, while still in the scorching heat

00:22:49.090 --> 00:22:55.140
Asa hiru eien ai o kushizashi narabete
Morning, midday, and eternally skewer desires and line them up

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:58.310
Gutsu gutsu mou! Nie nie da yo
Already simmering! It's boiling

00:22:58.560 --> 00:23:01.730
Yuuge wa jigoku de hot pot
Supper is a hot pot in Hell

00:23:01.900 --> 00:23:07.940
Nita mono doushi ni oniai no oshioki
For people who are alike, a suitable punishment

00:23:08.110 --> 00:23:11.070
Juu juu achi! Koge koge da yo
Sizzling hot! It's burned to a crisp

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:14.370
Anata to jigoku de hotcake
Hotcakes with you in Hell

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:19.790
Tokoyo no suna ni naru made
Until they become forever-unchanging sand

00:23:24.880 --> 00:23:26.760
NEXT TIME
ON HOZUKI'S
COOLHEADEDNESS...

00:23:25.250 --> 00:23:27.590
Where has Lord Satan gone off to?

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:31.220
He was at the video arcade
playing a video game with a fly or something.

00:23:28.470 --> 00:23:29.010
AND

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:30.840
BUT

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:33.300
Must've been the new game from Nekomata Nyanko.

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:33.640
SO

00:23:33.300 --> 00:23:35.390
Wait, are you heading off to a business reception?

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:39.180
At Lady Lilith's request, we're going
to go observe a mechanical chief of staff.

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:39.680
WE PRESENT:
GAMES
AND
MECHANICAL CHIEF OF STAFF

00:23:36.390 --> 00:23:39.680
PLEASE ENJOY!
